# Large prebuilt binaries are NOT in git (GitHub rejects >100MB files; agy alone
# is 181MB). They live only in the on-disk bundle and reach other machines via
# deploy-to.sh (rsync). See bin-sync.txt for the full manifest + provenance.
bin/*

# ... except the small user scripts, which are code and belong in git:
!bin/color-kitty
!bin/csv2gspread
!bin/lario-fleet
!bin/lario-gdrive-bisync
!bin/niricritty-record
!bin/niri-startup-workspaces
